  {
   "text": "No source puts the fire drill and the cruise strategy in one sequence. The fire procedure is applied without delay (FCTM), while the cruise flow sets MCT and A/THR off first and starts ECAM “when appropriate” (PDP). The brief keeps the fire drill first.",
